{
  "uid": "red-monolith",
  "title": "Monolith — RED & Golden Signals",
  "tags": ["techpix", "servicos", "red"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "**RED** para o serviço (linha 1: **R**ate · **E**rrors · **D**uration) · dependências e eventos (linha 2) · **USE** para os recursos (linha 3: Utilization · **Saturation = fila** · Errors). Gere tráfego com `scripts/demo-payment.sh` ou o k6 do painel." }
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "timeseries", "title": "R — Rate: requisições/s por rota",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[1m]))", "legendFormat": "TOTAL" },
        { "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"techpix-monolith\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[1m]))", "legendFormat": "{{uri}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "timeseries", "title": "E — Errors: % de respostas 5xx",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 3 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"techpix-monolith\",status=~\"5..\"}[1m])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[1m]))", "legendFormat": "5xx %" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 5 } ] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "timeseries", "title": "D — Duration: criação de pagamento (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 3 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(payment_create_seconds_bucket{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[5m])) by (le))", "legendFormat": "p50" },
        { "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(payment_create_seconds_bucket{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[5m])) by (le))", "legendFormat": "p95" },
        { "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(payment_create_seconds_bucket{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[5m])) by (le))", "legendFormat": "p99" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Dependência: chamada remota ao Fraud (latência média e retries)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "rate(fraud_remote_roundtrip_seconds_sum{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[1m]) / rate(fraud_remote_roundtrip_seconds_count{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[1m])", "legendFormat": "roundtrip médio" },
        { "expr": "rate(fraud_remote_retries_total{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[1m])", "legendFormat": "retries/s" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Eventos Kafka: publicados × falhas (dual write!)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 11 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "rate(payment_events_published_total{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[1m])", "legendFormat": "publicados/s" },
        { "expr": "rate(payment_events_failed_total{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[1m])", "legendFormat": "falhas/s" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 7, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Eficiência: consultas SQL por pagamento (lab 03/04)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 11 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "rate(payment_queries_sum{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[5m]) / rate(payment_queries_count{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}[5m])", "legendFormat": "SQL por pagamento" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 8, "type": "timeseries", "title": "USE — Utilization: CPU do processo e do sistema",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "process_cpu_usage{job=\"techpix-monolith\"} * 100", "legendFormat": "processo {{instance}}" },
        { "expr": "system_cpu_usage{job=\"techpix-monolith\"} * 100", "legendFormat": "sistema {{instance}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0, "max": 100, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 9, "type": "timeseries", "title": "USE — Saturation: pool HikariCP (pending = FILA = problema)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "hikaricp_connections_active{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}", "legendFormat": "ativas {{instance}}" },
        { "expr": "hikaricp_connections_pending{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}", "legendFormat": "PENDING {{instance}}" },
        { "expr": "hikaricp_connections_max{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}", "legendFormat": "max {{instance}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 10, "type": "timeseries", "title": "USE — memória heap",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum by (instance) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{job=\"techpix-monolith\",area=\"heap\"})", "legendFormat": "heap {{instance}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "timeseries", "title": "USE — threads vivas (Tomcat satura em fila de request)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "jvm_threads_live_threads{job=\"techpix-monolith\"}", "legendFormat": "threads {{instance}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    }
  ]
}
